  "about": "[NOT WIRED YET \u2014 Mike, 6 Oct, for \u00a7EW] Mike's list of areas: the 52 biomes (data/biomes) gathered into cohesive places, each to become its own ruins, temples and archetypal places (one pocket world each, \u00a7EW). Recorded by Claude Code from Mike's message; Claude (chat) logs it as a design section and reconciles it with worlds.json worlds (\u00a7EW.2's named worlds). The biomes stay as they are: an area only groups them.",
  "areas": "In Mike's order. name: Mike's words. biomes: the biomes his words name. proposed: Claude Code's suggested fold-ins, not decided, for Mike to keep or move (polar: the plain tundra between his polar desert and forest-tundra, alpine tundra, glaciers; prairie: steppe; jungle: tropical dry forest; savanna: thorn scrub; swamp: floodplain forest; dunes: hot desert; rocky shore: estuary; ocean: lagoon; volcanic: caves, for the volcano caves; canyons: badlands). rainforest: tropical, temperate, or both, is Mike's call.",
  "unassigned": "Biomes no area takes yet, neither named nor proposed: Mike's call whether they join an area, become their own, or stay out of Torchfire 1."
